OL,3,GNEWSATwo more men charged with murder
OL,4,Aof Alisha Samuels
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo more men have been charged with the
OL,7,Fmurder of a woman who was stabbed in a
OL,8,Fstreet in Manchester.
OL,10,FAlisha Samuels, 26, was found dead
OL,11,Fafter officers were called to a
OL,12,Fdisturbance on Dorking Avenue in the
OL,13,FNewton Heath area of the city at about
OL,14,F02:00 BST on 15 October.
OL,16,FCarl Hardy and Tony Evans, both 19,
OL,17,Fhave been charged with murder and the
OL,18,Fattempted murder of a man.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,408,400,260,160,0,100
