OL,3,GNEWSATwo more men charged with murder
OL,4,Aof Alisha Samuels
OL,5,
OL,6,FHardy, of Shaldon Drive, Manchester,
OL,7,Fand Evans, of Dorking Avenue, are due
OL,8,Fto appear at Manchester and Salford
OL,9,FMagistrates' Court on Friday.
